85	    /**
86	     * Derives the owner's locality: the plain canonical region resolved from its postcode. This is
87	     * the user-facing region and never carries the identity version tag, so it stays plain (for
88	     * example {@code "NSW"}) even though the {@code memberId} embeds a version-2 region code.
89	     */
